+<section class="hero wrap" aria-labelledby="page-title"><span class="eyebrow">Simple, honest pricing</span><h1 id="page-title">A better way to<br>work together.</h1><p>Less noise. More momentum. Pick the plan that fits your team.</p><div class="billing"><label for="yearly">Monthly</label><label><input type="checkbox" id="yearly" aria-label="Switch to yearly billing"><span class="switch" aria-hidden="true"></span></label><label for="yearly">Yearly</label><span class="saving">Save 20%</span></div></section>
