+<article class="card"><h2>Free</h2><div class="desc">A calmer place to start working together.</div><div class="price"><span class="amount" data-monthly="0" data-yearly="0">$0</span><span class="period">/ user / month</span></div><div class="billed">Always free</div><hr><p class="includes">INCLUDES</p><ul class="features"><li><span class="check">✓</span> Up to 10 people</li><li><span class="check">✓</span> 1:1 and group messaging</li><li><span class="check">✓</span> 90 days of message history</li><li><span class="check">✓</span> 5 GB shared storage</li></ul><a class="button" href="mailto:hello@relay.example?subject=Get%20started%20with%20Relay%20Free">Get started free</a></article>
