+<section class="section wrap" id="compare" aria-labelledby="compare-title"><div class="section-head"><h2 id="compare-title">Compare plans</h2><p>All the details, so you can choose with confidence.</p></div><div class="table-wrap" role="region" aria-label="Feature comparison" tabindex="0"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Features</th><th scope="col">Free</th><th scope="col" class="highlight-col">Team</th><th scope="col">Business</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="group"><td colspan="4">Messaging & collaboration</td></tr><tr><td>Message history</td><td>90 days</td><td class="highlight-col">Unlimited</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr><tr><td>People</td><td>Up to 10</td><td class="highlight-col">Unlimited</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr><tr><td>Group huddles & screen sharing</td><td class="no" aria-label="Not included">—</td><td class="highlight-col yes" aria-label="Included">✓</td><td class="yes" aria-label="Included">✓</td></tr><tr><td>Integrations</td><td>10</td><td class="highlight-col">Unlimited</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr><tr class="group"><td colspan="4">Storage & support</td></tr><tr><td>Shared file storage</td><td>5 GB</td><td class="highlight-col">25 GB / person</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr><tr><td>Priority 24/7 support</td><td class="no" aria-label="Not included">—</td><td class="highlight-col no" aria-label="Not included">—</td><td class="yes" aria-label="Included">✓</td></tr><tr class="group"><td colspan="4">Security & administration</td></tr><tr><td>SAML single sign-on</td><td class="no" aria-label="Not included">—</td><td class="highlight-col no" aria-label="Not included">—</td><td class="yes" aria-label="Included">✓</td></tr><tr><td>User provisioning (SCIM)</td><td class="no" aria-label="Not included">—</td><td class="highlight-col no" aria-label="Not included">—</td><td class="yes" aria-label="Included">✓</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
+<section class="faq wrap" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title"><div class="section-head"><h2 id="faq-title">Frequently asked questions</h2><p>A few things you might be wondering.</p></div><details><summary>Can I try Team before paying?</summary><div class="answer"><p>Absolutely. Team includes a 14-day free trial, with no credit card required. You can invite your whole team and explore everything before deciding.</p></div></details><details><summary>What happens when I switch to yearly billing?</summary><div class="answer"><p>You save 20% on Team and Business when you pay yearly. The per-user monthly equivalent updates above, and your subscription is billed once per year. Free stays free.</p></div></details><details><summary>Can I change or cancel my plan at any time?</summary><div class="answer"><p>Yes. Upgrade, downgrade, or cancel whenever you need to. If you cancel a paid plan, you’ll keep access through the end of your billing period.</p></div></details><details><summary>How does per-user pricing work?</summary><div class="answer"><p>Paid plans are priced per active member each month. Add or remove people as your team changes, and your bill adjusts accordingly.</p></div></details><details><summary>Is my team’s data secure?</summary><div class="answer"><p>Your data is encrypted in transit and at rest. Business adds SAML single sign-on, SCIM provisioning, and dedicated priority support.</p></div></details></section>
